          "text_en": "family. My family is big.\nfather. My father is a date farmer.\nmother. My mother is at home.\nbrother. My brother is twelve.\nsister. Her sister is a nurse.\ngrandfather. My grandfather is from Seiyun.\ngrandmother. Our grandmother is kind.\nuncle. My uncle is a driver.\naunt. My aunt is a teacher.\ncousin. Khaled is my cousin.\nson. Ahmed is their son.\ndaughter. Maha is their daughter.\nyoung. My sister is young. She is six.\nold. My grandfather is old."
